	<item>
		<title>DOJO!! Back Online</title>
		<link>http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/notices/dojo-back-online</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2015 16:20:25 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Sirtopeia]]></dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[Notices]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/?p=5114</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[If you are unaware, McleodGaming suffered a server crash this week, and had to recover from backups. The DOJO!! has now been recovered, but for reasons unknown, we lost some of our media files. At this point we only seem to be missing certain music files. We&#8217;re working to get these files back online ASAP.]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>If you are unaware, McleodGaming suffered a server crash this week, and had to recover from backups.</p>
<p>The DOJO!! has now been recovered, but for reasons unknown, we lost some of our media files. At this point we only seem to be missing certain music files.</p>
<p>We&#8217;re working to get these files back online ASAP.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
