		<item>
		<title>Dracula&#8217;s Castle</title>
		<link>http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/stages/draculas-castle</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 07 Jan 2014 08:45:03 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[SSF2 DOJO Team]]></dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[Stages]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/?p=5052</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Dracula&#8217;s Castle is one of the defining locations in the Castlevania series. It&#8217;s gotten some visual updates for the new version, but it retains its charm. How ominous. The focus of this stage is on the three platforms that float above it. There&#8217;s something unusual about how they&#8217;re arranged, though&#8230; Their alignment won&#8217;t stop changing! [&#8230;]]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img alt="" src="http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/dracfull.png" height="275px" /></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Dracula&#8217;s Castle is one of the defining locations in the Castlevania series. It&#8217;s gotten some visual updates for the new version, but it retains its charm.</p>
<p><img alt="" src="http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/drac1.png" height="220px" /><br />
<strong>How ominous.</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">The focus of this stage is on the three platforms that float above it. There&#8217;s something unusual about how they&#8217;re arranged, though&#8230;</p>
<p><img alt="" src="http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/drac2.png" height="220px" /><br />
<img alt="" src="http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/drac3.png" height="220px" /><br />
<img alt="" src="http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/dract.png" height="220px" /><br />
<b>Their alignment won&#8217;t stop changing!</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Don&#8217;t worry about it getting too crazy, though. You&#8217;ll get a chance to fight for a bit on each layout before it changes again.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
			</item>
