		<item>
		<title>Victini</title>
		<link>http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/items/pokeballs/victini</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 03 Jan 2014 08:24:09 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[SSF2 DOJO Team]]></dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[Pokeballs]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/?p=5033</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[As a legendary Pokémon, Victini is suitably rare, but also suitably powerful. It brings total destruction with it&#8217;s signature attack, V-create! Small, but incredibly powerful. Victini will rapidly move around an opponent in a circular pattern, dealing damage if it makes contact. If you start getting hit, you might find yourself getting KO&#8217;d soon after! Yikes! Don&#8217;t [&#8230;]]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/Victini.png" height="350px"><img class="size-full wp-image-3835 aligncenter" alt="Victini" src="http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/Victini.png" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">As a legendary Pokémon, Victini is suitably rare, but also suitably powerful. It brings total destruction with it&#8217;s signature attack, V-create!</p>
<p><img alt="" src="http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/victini1.png" height="220px" /><br />
<strong>Small, but incredibly powerful.</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Victini will rapidly move around an opponent in a circular pattern, dealing damage if it makes contact. If you start getting hit, you might find yourself getting KO&#8217;d soon after!</p>
<p><img alt="" src="http://ssfdojo.mcleodgaming.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/victini2.png" height="220px" /><br />
<strong>Yikes! Don&#8217;t get too close!</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">If you make sure you stay still or only move slowly, you might be able to avoid getting in Victini&#8217;s path. Your opponents might have something to say about that, though.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
			</item>
